Z||000011||Philphine||07-02-2001||03:56 PM||||irm you have to call i think. someone else might know a web addy. i got mine a while back so i don't know the number off hand either.<P>be prepared to wait. it takes them a while to make the order (they don't stock them) and ship it. they are easier to keep in touch with than outlaw though.<P>and thats the rub. probaly it takes just as long or longer to get them from irm, but they tell you that up front, and if it takes even longer you can find that out too. mine took even longer 'cause the lady in charge of taking orders went on vacation during the time mine were being made and nothing went out till she came back, but at least they told me and i knew i had to wait.<P>with outlaw they say they'll ship 10 days after the payment is recieved then you hear little or nothing and you wonder if they even got the payment or are even working on the order. if you're lucky one day weeks or months later it shows up (some people are still waiting). frustrates me to no end.<P>see...i told you not to get me started.<p>[This message has been edited by Philphine (edited 07-02-2001).]||||reg||1
